      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1792325380700,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- And you can see that through the storage that we've\n  provisioned that this particular text file has saved\n  from when we stopped the instance.\n- And it transferred over to when we've brought back up\n  the container.\n- So we've reattached the storage and all that information \n  that has been saved into that storage.\n\n- This is a good example of how you can save certain data, \n  certain code files, or other artifacts that come with the\n  experimentation and model training and validation phase.",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- And you can see that through the storage that we've\n  provisioned that this particular text file has saved\n  from when we stopped the instance.\n- And it transferred over to when we've brought back up\n  the container.\n- So we've reattached the storage and all that information \n  that has been saved into that storage.\n\n- This is a good example of how you can save certain data, \n  certain code files, or other artifacts that come with the\n  experimentation and model training and validation phase.",
